a0a&_nc_ohc=0R0YzaV6mwUQ7kNvwHatEGd&_nc_oc=AdkeUnUD4nrN1MyUfCZ4DaWIRh2N0dR_tgybUq98V2gZ2m9vP4WoryTYQX1QSi6Sl9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afudl8ThSUevFH5od23mDoxW3q6FWXB2pmUUlTEMDkbIVw&oe=699EF37D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "EmatahnCoverHiRes.png", "id": "511241218457028", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575352_511241221790361_760251907399571310_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Te0gvI1kcoIQ7kNvwG5pUwy&_nc_oc=AdnuISwL7xL-MmxF8ih4QkmzALqj0TAjjUww7eBKK0X8mhB4MGBqfusUKP7cwEotlEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvU4RLUhwVvRnsVgk_XVCzR7gE5gujNevbff1uLc-B0DA&oe=699EFB12"}, "display_name": "Legend of the Ematahn", "keywords": ["Action", "Adventure", "Physics", "Combat", "Magic"], "long_description": "# Embark on a new adventure!\n\nAs you're beginning to make friends with a nearby village, a new group emerges that threatens the stability of the Highlands. Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?\n\n# Features\n\n* An original story with 18 unique quests.\n* A physics based combat system with magic.\n* VR climbing and platforming quests.\n* Boss fights.\n* 5 different factions with unique characters and dialog.\n* Survival mode with 6 different maps.\n* More to be added in future updates!", "short_description": "Embark on a new adventure! Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?"}]}, "developer_name": null,